      "id": "claim_d7cfee0c32cc4329be15e26a8955caf4",
      "statement": "createCapabilityRegistry validates each capability at construction, rejecting duplicate capability ids (DUPLICATE_CAPABILITY), duplicate bindings (DUPLICATE_BINDING), invalid schemas (INVALID_CAPABILITY), and a missing error reporter for a non-empty catalog (MISSING_ERROR_REPORTER); construction is fail-closed and createSliceARegistry throws on failure.",
