      "id": "claim_b9392d24ef024dbfbf556327e56e8d84",
      "statement": "Authorisation is per-call: the registry checks principal.permissions.has(capability.authorization.permission) on every invocation, returning UNAUTHENTICATED when no principal and FORBIDDEN when the permission is absent; some handlers add finer-grained checks such as FORBIDDEN_FULL when full detail is requested without the recruiter role.",
